{"game": "earth-defense-force-5", "language": "english", "appid": 1007040, "month": "2020-08", "window": 3, "start_date": 1597536000, "end_date": 1598227199, "month_true_total": 51, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-28 17:49:06 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "74754707", "author": {"steamid": "76561198062541193", "personaname": "Doggirl Jester", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198062541193/", "num_games_owned": 414, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 7458, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5005, "last_played": 1669784794, "avatar": "57624407ebbf8eb2e2315aca5756534b9b7cf440"}, "language": "english", "review": "bugs boobs and booms(big)", "timestamp_created": 1598145819, "timestamp_updated": 1642457896, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.492728352546691895", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "74702996", "author": {"steamid": "76561198079801586", "personaname": "Thorhammer", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/gen1sigurd/", "num_games_owned": 280, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 8166, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6236, "last_played": 1722997531, "avatar": "bf57261641cf60733742945aec9590f02a256d95"}, "language": "english", "review": "After beating the game solo as Ranger, I wholly recommend this game, either as someone's first entry or as a returning EDF soldier! Especially because the big battles are even more ridiculous then what 4.1 had to offer.\n\nYou are limited to hard mode as your highest difficulty up until you beat the game for the first time. I think it's a decent bar to entering Hardest or Inferno considering that\n- you'd have gone through the game and naturally progressed weapon level wise, so relative combat strength has stayed somewhat consistent versus the aliens (with an occasional difficulty spike)\n-more than likely, you have enough armor stepping into Hardest at the least to survive a few seconds of damage. Maybe not the in the face shotgun spiders, though....\n-you have a decent arsenal to farm certain Inferno missions, and break some missions if you really wanted to, versus in 4.1 where I felt you kinda had to jump around struggling until you broke through with a few Inferno drops here and there.\n\nWith that, plus some overall good additions across the board (Ranger's Sprint, item pickup aura for certain actions and vehicles, Hard mode clears Normal/Easy too, etc.), and the weapon upgrade system giving repeat drops some value still (to a point), I'd say you get a healthy modern take on the bug blasting game.\n\nSide note, I felt like the moments in the last bit of missions were for some reason gripping, even if the overall plot is at times more B movie than in 4.1.", "timestamp_created": 1598071571, "timestamp_updated": 1598071571, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 5, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.538829267024993896", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 20, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "74693219", "author": {"steamid": "76561198058191281", "personaname": "Breaded_Toast", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198058191281/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 8818, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3476, "last_played": 1720137270, "avatar": "f42c927645df1da421d97509dc8f820619b5b1e4"}, "language": "english", "review": "Yes", "timestamp_created": 1598054275, "timestamp_updated": 1598054275, "voted_up": true, "votes_up":